+// op/shape key over all graph evaluations and printed at exit. One event per loop iteration on the compute stream; the
+// interval to the next event is the unit's time. Only active when CUDA graphs are off (GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_GRAPHS=1),
+// since the loop only runs on capture otherwise. =2 also dumps the unit sequence of the first decode-sized graph.
