+// GDN layer tail (fusion tree, sm_61): per-head RMS_NORM(gdn output) * weight -> silu(z) * normed (SWIGLU split) ->
+// Hadamard signs -> FWHT (block width N) -> q8_1 rows in the SOA_ISUM layout the one-column PTQ1_0 mat-vec (ssm_out) reads.
